# Session Handoff

- rotation_reason: manager_exit_contract_repair
- previous_launch_kind: resume
- previous_tool_resume_target: ${resume_target:-unavailable}
- worktree_path: $project

## Repair Contract
- reason: ${reason:-manager_exit_contract_invalid}
- contract_file: $contract_file
- details: ${details:-missing}

## What To Handle First
- Do not restart broad patrol first.
- Reuse the same manager context and produce a valid manager exit contract before any other closeout claim.
- The missing/invalid contract is the blocking defect from the previous round.
EOF
}

write_manager_resume_handoff() {
